flowchart LR
	PORT["Aphrodite's CCR pipeline ported into the family"]
	HOOK["the tools/post-execute waterfall -<br/>the interceptable wrapper around every normalized<br/>dispatch result, before it becomes model content"]
	BIG["oversized results of the allow-listed target tools"]
	MARKER["replaced with a one-line type-aware preview plus<br/>the CCR marker - the 24hex hash, then the type, then the size"]
	RETRIEVE["the original retrievable through the registered<br/>ccr_retrieve tool over a sha256-24 LRU store"]
	AUTO["autoExpand returns small results FULL<br/>while they are cheap - no marker reaches the model"]
	VISIBLE["the compression deliberately VISIBLE at the result layer -<br/>the opposite of the governance family's silence"]
	PORT --> HOOK
	HOOK --> BIG
	BIG --> MARKER
	MARKER --> RETRIEVE
	BIG -. "small and cheap" .-> AUTO
	PORT --> VISIBLE
